MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_MoonLass:
    .string "People say Clefairy dance under\n"
    .string "the moonlight.\p"
    .string "Down here, I think they just do\n"
    .string "whatever they want.$"


MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_BugCatcherOne:
    .string "I came here looking for Bug\n"
    .string "Pokemon.\p"
    .string "So far I've found rocks, fairies,\n"
    .string "and something that laughed at me.$"


MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_Scientist:
    .string "The species living here don't fit\n"
    .string "the usual cave pattern.\p"
    .string "Something about Mt. Moon seems to\n"
    .string "draw unusual Pokemon in.$"


MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_BugCatcherTwo:
    .string "An Impidimp stole my snack.\p"
    .string "I chased it for ten minutes.\p"
    .string "Then it came back and watched me\n"
    .string "look for it.$"


MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_Youngster:
    .string "Adults keep saying Mt. Moon isn't\n"
    .string "that big.\p"
    .string "Adults are wrong.$"


MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_Hiker:
    .string "There are old paths deeper in.\p"
    .string "Some were used by people who\n"
    .string "didn't want to be noticed.\p"
    .string "Most hikers know better than to\n"
    .string "ask why.$"


MtMoon_1F_Frlg_Text_OldMan:
    .string "I've been coming through Mt. Moon\n"
    .string "for years.\p"
    .string "Every time someone maps it, they\n"
    .string "find another path.$"

